+
+Filters
+
+*   [`org.apache.log4j.varia.DenyAllFilter`](https://logging.apache.org/log4j/2.x/plugin-reference.html#org-apache-logging-log4j_log4j-1-2-api_org-apache-log4j-builders-filter-DenyAllFilterBuilder),
+
